---
import ProgramDetailPage from '../../components/ProgramDetailPage.astro';
---

<ProgramDetailPage
  title="Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program (OINP) | Entrypoint Canada"
  description="Learn about Ontario's Workforce Priority stream, who may qualify, and how to check the current Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program requirements before applying."
  kicker="Ontario Immigration"
  heading="Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program (OINP)"
  summary="Ontario's Workforce Priority stream is for eligible workers with Ontario job offers and certain self-employed physicians. A nomination lets you apply to IRCC for permanent residence; Ontario does not make the final decision."
  badges={[
    'Two job-offer categories: TEER 0-3 and TEER 4-5',
    'Separate category for self-employed physicians',
    'Ontario must invite you before you can apply',
    'IRCC makes the final permanent residence decision',
  ]}
  sections={[
    {
      title: 'What changed in Ontario',
      body: 'Ontario replaced eight former streams in 2026 and began accepting expressions of interest for the Workforce Priority stream on August 4. It will not issue new invitations under the old streams. If you applied after receiving an invitation under an old stream, Ontario assesses that application under the rules in effect when you submitted it.',
      bullets: [
        'Ontario Workforce Priority: TEER 0-3 category',
        'Ontario Workforce Priority: TEER 4-5 category',
        'Ontario Workforce Priority: self-employed physician category',
      ],
    },
    {
      title: 'How the application process starts',
      body: 'For a job-offer category, your employer starts in the Ontario Employer Portal. You then register an expression of interest (EOI) and can apply for nomination only if Ontario invites you. Eligible self-employed physicians follow a separate registration process without a job offer.',
      bullets: [
        'Check the job, employer, and applicant requirements for your category',
        'Ontario offers an Express Entry nomination option for TEER 0-3 job-offer applicants and self-employed physicians who meet the applicable federal requirements',
        'If you registered under a former stream and were not invited, check whether you and your employer need to start a new registration',
      ],
    },
    {
      title: 'Regional nominations in Ontario',
      body: 'Ontario launched a new round of its Regional Economic Development through Immigration (REDI) initiative in October 2026, scheduled to run through the end of 2027. It sets aside nomination spaces in participating communities through OINP. There is no separate REDI application, and applicants still need to meet OINP requirements.',
    },
    {
      title: 'What to check before registering',
      body: 'Start with the category that matches your job offer or medical practice. Check which parts of your work history, language results, and employer documents Ontario asks for. If the Ontario stream is not a fit, look separately at whether you qualify for a federal program such as the Canadian Experience Class.',
    },
  ]}
  noteTitle="Eligibility and scoring are different"
  noteBody="In October 2026, Ontario updated how it awards points for Canadian earnings history. The change affects EOI ranking, not the minimum stream requirements. Check Ontario's current scoring rules and invitation notices before relying on a previous score or draw."
  sourceLinks={[
    { label: 'Ontario Workforce Priority stream criteria', href: 'https://www.ontario.ca/page/ontario-workforce-priority-stream' },
    { label: 'Ontario OINP application process', href: 'https://www.ontario.ca/page/oinp-application-process' },
    { label: 'Ontario 2026 OINP updates', href: 'https://www.ontario.ca/page/2026-ontario-immigrant-nominee-program-updates' },
    { label: 'Ontario invitations to apply', href: 'https://www.ontario.ca/page/invitations-apply-oinp' },
    { label: 'O. Reg. 422/17', href: 'https://www.ontario.ca/laws/regulation/170422' },
    { label: 'O. Reg. 421/17', href: 'https://www.ontario.ca/laws/regulation/170421' },
  ]}
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Programs overview', href: '/programs/' },
    { label: 'PGWP pathway', href: '/programs/pgwp/' },
    { label: 'Book a consultation', href: '/contact/' },
  ]}
  reviewedOn="2026-11-08"
  schemaName="Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program (OINP)"
  schemaTopics={[
    'Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program',
    'Ontario Workforce Priority Stream',
    'Provincial Nominee Program',
    'Ontario immigration',
    'Cambridge immigration consultant',
  ]}
/>
